# Lever: one kernel (ggml-cuda gated_delta_net.cu); warp_reduce_sum width 32 -> 8, so the reduction order changes and outputs are NOT bitwise stack9's.
# Identity: "cross-arm" cannot hold (a changed sum order moves sampled tokens at temperature 1) and "off" is refused for one stream, so
# "within-arm": each arm must reproduce its own tokens and draft counters across its two boots (determinism of the new kernel, rc 6 otherwise).
# The 6 texts per depth are the sample unit (same prompt and seeds, texts differ across arms): read g4_minus_s9_stats over texts, not one text.
# Negative control: the boot-to-boot ms/round delta of the same arm (ABBA) is the noise floor; the numeric check of the kernel is bw-s9-gdn4 (CUDA0 and CUDA1, mutants).
